### 1. Total Fare Value
```dax
Total Fare Value =
SUM(FactFare[Total Fare])
```

### 2. Fare Average
```dax
Fare Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Total Fare])
```

### 3. Highest Fare
```dax
Highest Fare =
MAX(FactFare[Total Fare])
```

### 4. Lowest Fare
```dax
Lowest Fare =
MIN(FactFare[Total Fare])
```

### 5. Base Fare Average
```dax
Base Fare Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Base Fare])
```

### 6. Additional Charges Average
```dax
Additional Charges Average =
[Fare Average] - [Base Fare Average]
```

### 7. Fare Markup %
```dax
Fare Markup % =
DIVIDE(
    [Fare Average] - [Base Fare Average],
    [Base Fare Average]
)
```

### 8. Overall Fare per KM
```dax
Overall Fare per KM =
DIVIDE(
    [Total Fare Value],
    [Distance Total]
)
```

### 9. Average Fare per KM
```dax
Average Fare per KM =
DIVIDE(
    [Fare Average],
    [Distance Average]
)
```

### 10. Reservation Charge Average
```dax
Reservation Charge Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Reservation Charge])
```

### 11. Superfast Charge Average
```dax
Superfast Charge Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Superfast Charge])
```

### 12. Service Tax Average
```dax
Service Tax Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Service Tax])
```

### 13. Dynamic Fare Average
```dax
Dynamic Fare Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Dynamic Fare])
```

### 14. Catering Charge Average
```dax
Catering Charge Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Catering Charge])
```

### 15. Other Charge Average
```dax
Other Charge Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Other Charge])
```

### 16. Distance Total
```dax
Distance Total =
SUM(FactFare[Distance (km)])
```

### 17. Distance Average
```dax
Distance Average =
AVERAGE(FactFare[Distance (km)])
```

### 18. Active Train Count
```dax
Active Train Count =
DISTINCTCOUNT(FactFare[Train Number])
```

### 19. Unique Route Count
```dax
Unique Route Count =
COUNTROWS(
    SUMMARIZE(
        FactFare,
        FactFare[From Station],
        FactFare[To Station]
    )
)
```
